From a61ee9db7e8836ba30a70f64b41be2d17b027490 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:41:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v33c: the game's own PER / USG% / win shares / VORP, used
 by the awards

- league.js computeAdv (B-Ref formulas per team stint, RS + playoffs, frozen at season end), advCareer,
  advBackfill for older saves. Check: league PER 15.00, USG% 20.0, team WS vs wins corr 0.98.
- History: tools/hx-adv.py.txt recomputes PER / USG% / WS / WS48 for every past NBA season (and traded
  stints) into NBA_HX; 1977-2026 identical to B-Ref, all eras PER 0.998 / WS 0.996 (v33c-hx-check.txt).
- Awards blend game score / record / defensive composite with WS, WS48, PER, BPM, DWS, DBPM
  (AW_ADV; on:false = old scoring). 10 seasons NBA, new vs old: MVP top-3 WS 9/10 (5/10),
  DPOY top-5 DWS 6/10 (2/10), more varied winners.
- UI: Players table, player Advanced tab (RS + PO + career), leaders, records, award ladders and pages,
  History list. Tests: t33c 23/23, t30a, t32f, t32e, browser-v33c 46/46, lint.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CCg2PRkHukDe6vM5CzazU7
